WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Cuba has startups, real startups

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Real companies. Real products.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Espoleta Technologies builds drones that measure weather patterns for farmers. 

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Dataplus installs smart sensors in factories 

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
And then there is the crypto ecosystem. QvaShop and HeavenEx are Cuban platforms where people buy and sell using cryptocurrency.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:22.800
Why? 

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Because when the traditional banking system is blocked, you find another way.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
And let us not forget the freelancers. 

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.500
Cuban programmers, designers, and writers are working on Upwork, Fiverr, and Toptal 

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Earning dollars from their living rooms.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.000
The knowledge economy is real. 

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Cuba has 290 software companies. Eighty-eight of them are private.